{"type":"message","id":"56f235c1","parentId":"25ebe29d","timestamp":"2026-07-24T03:11:55.827Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-07-24 11:11:55 GMT+8] Exec failed (keen-bre, code 1) :: 登录检查失败: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0) 搜索 旅游 出错: HTTPConnectionPool(host='localhost', port=18060): Read timed out. (read timeout=120)\n\nRead HEARTBEAT.md if it exists (workspace context). Follow it strictly. Do not infer or repeat old tasks from prior chats. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.\nWhen reading HEARTBEAT.md, use workspace file C:/Users/linkang/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md (exact case). Do not read docs/heartbeat.md.\nCurrent time: Friday, July 24th, 2026 — 11:11 (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-07-24 03:11 UTC"}],"timestamp":1784862715825}}
{"type":"message","id":"8b8f73dc","parentId":"56f235c1","timestamp":"2026-07-24T03:11:59.214Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The system is reporting an exec failure from a previous session called \"keen-bre\". Let me check the HEARTBEAT.md file first."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7jsts32npfyq_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:/Users/linkang/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784862715827}}
{"type":"message","id":"aca95bd0","parentId":"8b8f73dc","timestamp":"2026-07-24T03:11:59.230Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_7jsts32npfyq_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Heartbeat\n\n每次心跳唤醒时，按以下逻辑判断是否需要主动联系用户。\n\n## 时间感知\n\n根据当前时间（Asia/Shanghai）判断所处时段：\n- **工作日 9:30-11:30** — 上午工作时段\n- **工作日 13:30-18:00** — 下午工作时段\n- **工作日 11:30-13:30** — 午休，不打扰\n- **18:00 之后** — 下班时间，不打扰\n- **周末** — 休息日，不打扰\n\n## 检查规则\n\n仅在工作时段执行以下检查，其他时间直接回复 HEARTBEAT_OK。\n\n### 1. 喝水提醒（10:30 / 14:30 / 16:30 附近）\n简短提醒喝水，不超过一句话。每次都要提醒，不要因为之前提醒过就跳过。\n\n### 2. 久坐提醒（连续工作超过 2 小时的时间点）\n建议站起来活动一下，不要说教。每次都要提醒。\n\n### 3. 周五 17:00 附近\n提醒写周报。每次都要提醒直到用户确认已写。\n\n## 原则\n\n- 不打扰优先：有疑问时选择沉默，回复 HEARTBEAT_OK\n- 重复提醒：喝水、久坐、周报这类事项每次心跳都可以提醒，不要怕重复\n- 简短：提醒不超过 2 行\n- 可以催进度：工作时段内可以主动问用户在做什么、进展如何，适当推一把\n- 午休（11:30-13:30）和下班后（18:00+）绝对不打扰\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784862719228}}
{"type":"message","id":"c40fe661","parentId":"aca95bd0","timestamp":"2026-07-24T03:12:03.625Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Current time: 2026-07-24 11:11:55 CST (Friday)\nThis is within work hours (9:30-11:30 morning session).\nIt's Friday, so I should check if it's around 17:00 for 周报提醒.\n\n11:11 is within work hours but not near 10:30, 14:30, or 16:30 for water reminders.\n\nIt's Friday, but 11:11 is not near 17:00 for 周报 reminder.\n\nNo specific reminder triggered at this time. But the system message shows an exec error occurred in a prior task (keen-bre session) related to 小红书 MCP. \n\nThe MCP service might be down, but that's not something I need to address right now—the heartbeat check doesn't call for any action, so I'll just respond with HEARTBEAT_OK."},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784862719230}}
